<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Pembinaan YCS shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Pembinaan YCS shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Pembinaan YCS Bhd were suspended on Thursday pending an announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Stock of Pembinaan YCS, a civil engineering and construction company, closed at 13.60 ringgit on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Officials of the company were not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
